---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sample selection — Blackbook Racing"
  description="A real Blackbook Racing selection, sourced from the morning of 2026-05-10. The format Blackbook members see — race profile, runner profile, stake and conviction tag."
>
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sample</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">A selection, as we publish it</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A real selection, sourced from the morning of 2026-05-10. The full briefing below is the
      Blackbook-tier format — race context, runner profile, stake and conviction tag. The
      compact preview underneath is the Free-tier version of the same selection.
    </p>

    <!-- ===== Blackbook-tier full briefing ===== -->
    <p class="tier-tag-line"><span class="tier-tag tier-tag-blackbook">Blackbook</span> The full pre-off briefing</p>
    <div class="pick-card">
      <div class="pick-head">▲ BLACKBOOK <span class="bar">|</span> 2026-05-10 <span class="dot">·</span> 16:02 LUDLOW</div>
      <div class="pick-race">Welsh Guards Association Handicap Hurdle <span class="dot">·</span> Class 4 <span class="dot">·</span> 7 runners <span class="dot">·</span> 16f <span class="dot">·</span> Good</div>

      <div class="pick-horse">ZUCAYAN</div>
      <div class="pick-horse-meta">9yo gelding <span class="dot">·</span> cloth #5</div>

      <div class="pick-market">
        <div><span class="lab">Stake</span> 1pt @ Betfair SP</div>
        <div><span class="lab">Price</span> ~5.5 (captured 08:14 BST)</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pick-section">
        <p class="section-label">The race</p>
        <p>
          Seven-runner Class 4 handicap hurdle on Good ground at sharp right-handed Ludlow over
          16f. The pace map flags a likely lone leader, so the race shapes as a tactical affair
          that hold-up types must deliver into. Wide ratings spread across the field, three long
          absentees, one significant class drop from Class 2, and a clear top of the market.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pick-section">
        <p class="section-label">Why Zucayan</p>
        <p>
          Course specialist at Ludlow — 8 prior runs, 37.5% strike rate, +27% return over
          field-baseline expectation. Tops the field on our top-speed rating with an upward trend
          over recent runs. Trainer's career profile shows a +16% return on investment overall.
          Long-absentee flag adds further historical lift in our value cohort.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pick-section conviction">
        <span class="section-label">Conviction</span>
        <span class="conviction-value">A &mdash; top tier on today's slate <span class="dot">·</span> Clear (Level 3)</span>
      </div>

      <div class="pick-footnote">
        Logged 08:14 BST <span class="dot">·</span> pre-off <span class="dot">·</span> team-reviewed
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== Free-tier compact preview ===== -->
    <p class="tier-tag-line below"><span class="tier-tag tier-tag-free">Free</span> The compact version of the same selection</p>
    <div class="pick-card pick-card-free">
      <div class="pick-head">▲ BLACKBOOK FREE <span class="bar">|</span> 2026-05-10 <span class="dot">·</span> 16:02 LUDLOW</div>
      <div class="pick-race-compact">Class 4 handicap hurdle <span class="dot">·</span> 16f <span class="dot">·</span> Good</div>
      <div class="pick-horse">ZUCAYAN</div>
      <div class="pick-horse-meta">9yo gelding <span class="dot">·</span> cloth #5</div>
      <div class="pick-market">
        <div><span class="lab">Stake</span> 1pt @ Betfair SP</div>
        <div><span class="lab">Price</span> ~5.5</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pick-footnote">Logged 08:14 BST <span class="dot">·</span> pre-off</div>
    </div>

    <p class="note">
      The Free-tier message drops the conviction tag and the team-reviewed line, plus the long-form
      race profile and runner profile. Same selection, tighter daily message. <br />
      Today's top selection happens to be a hurdle, which under our product is a Blackbook-tier
      exclusive — the Free tier covers UK flat racing only. On a flat day, the Free tier card
      is the anchor.
    </p>
  </article>

  <style>
    .page {
      padding-top: 16px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 40px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .lede {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 56px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .tier-tag-line {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-mute);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .tier-tag-line.below {
      margin-top: 64px;
    }

    .tier-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    .tier-tag-free {
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .tier-tag-blackbook {
      background: var(--gold);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .pick-card {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--cream);
      padding: 36px 40px;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-feature-settings: 'tnum';
    }

    .pick-card-free {
      padding: 28px 32px;
      max-width: 560px;
    }

    .pick-head {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .pick-head .bar {
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.45);
      margin: 0 6px;
    }

    .pick-head .dot {
      margin: 0 4px;
    }

    .pick-race,
    .pick-race-compact {
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.72);
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .pick-race .dot,
    .pick-race-compact .dot,
    .pick-horse-meta .dot {
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.45);
      margin: 0 5px;
    }

    .pick-horse {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--cream);
      margin: 18px 0 4px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .pick-horse-meta {
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.65);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .pick-market {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.18);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.18);
      font-size: 14px;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.85);
    }

    .pick-market .lab {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .pick-section {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.18);
    }

    .pick-section p {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.92);
    }

    .pick-section .section-label {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: block;
    }

    .pick-section.conviction {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .conviction-value {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--cream);
    }

    .conviction .dot {
      color: var(--gold);
      margin: 0 6px;
    }

    .pick-footnote {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.18);
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.55);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .pick-footnote .dot {
      margin: 0 6px;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.45);
    }

    .note {
      font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--ink-mute);
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 36px auto 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .page-title {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      .lede {
        font-size: 17px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .pick-card {
        padding: 28px 22px;
      }

      .pick-card-free {
        padding: 22px 20px;
      }

      .pick-horse {
        font-size: 30px;
      }

      .pick-section p {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .pick-market {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
